{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55509","headline":"上亭驿（题拟） · 罗隐","name":"上亭驿（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细（《舆地纪胜》、《天中记》作「山」）雨霏微宿上亭，雨中因感（《舆地纪胜》、《天中记》作「想」）雨淋铃。\n贵爲天子犹魂断，穷着荷衣好涕零。\n剑水多端何处去，巴猿无赖不堪听。\n少年辛苦今飘荡，空（一作「深」）媿先生教聚萤。\n（见宋王灼《碧鷄漫志》卷五。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷六六五据《天中记》收首二句，《全唐诗续补遗》卷十六据《舆地纪胜》卷一八六收前四句，均不全，今重录之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}